o recommit to the Committee on Veterans' Affairs. (CR H3692)","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H35000","actionDate":"2026-05-21","source":"House floor actions","text":"The previous question was ordered pursuant to the rule.","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H8D000","actionDate":"2026-05-21","source":"House floor actions","text":"DEBATE - The House proceeded with one hour of debate on H.R. 1041.","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H8D000","actionDate":"2026-05-21","source":"House floor actions","text":"Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 1041, H.R. 6047 and H.R. 1329. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 1041, H.R. 6047, and H.R. 1329 under a closed rule. The resolution provides for one hour of general debate and one motion to recommit on each bill.","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H30000","actionDate":"2026-05-21","source":"House floor actions","text":"Considered under the provisions of rule H. Res. 1300. (consideration: CR H3684-3692)","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H1L210","actionDate":"2026-05-19","source":"House floor actions","text":"Rules Committee Resolution H. Res. 1300 Reported to House. Rule provides for consideration of H.R. 1041, H.R. 6047 and H.R. 1329. The resolution provides for consideration of H.R. 1041, H.R. 6047, and H.R. 1329 under a closed rule. The resolution provides for one hour of general debate and one motion to recommit on each bill.","type":"Floor"},{"actionCode":"H12410","actionDate":"2025-06-05","source":"House floor actions","text":"Placed on the Union Calendar, Calendar No. 112.","type":"Calendars"},{"actionCode":"H12200","actionDate":"2025-06-05","source":"House floor actions","text":"Reported (Amended) by the Committee on Veterans' Affairs. H. Rept. 119-143.","type":"Committee"},{"actionCode":"5000","actionDate":"2025-06-05","source":"Library of Congress","text":"Reported (Amended) by the Committee on Veterans' Affairs. H. Rept. 119-143.","type":"Committee"},{"actionCode":"H19000","actionDate":"2025-05-06","source":"House co